# Go build and test outputs
/bin/
coverage.out
*.test
*.prof
# `go build ./cmd/<name>` at the repository root writes the binary here under the command's
# name. Keep the leading slash: unanchored, the pattern would also ignore cmd/<name>/.
/gateway-*

# Local multi-repository workspace only
go.work
go.work.sum

# Python tooling (contract checks and the black-box runner)
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Black-box runtime output: keys, certificates, rendered config, the binary under test and
# process logs are regenerated on every run.
tests/acceptance/blackbox/.run/

# 本机联调用的 Gatekeeper：证书、密钥、下载的二进制和测试客户端凭据。
tests/integration/gatekeeper/.run/
